      "hasCode": true,
      "codeArchiveId": "2020-zhu-zhenpeng-smartcampus",
      "details": {
        "skills": "Python 应用编程（xlrd 读入、xlwt 写入、xlutils 格式转换、Tkinter 相对布局窗体控件）、微信小程序开发（WXML/WXSS/JavaScript、云开发 CloudBase 数据库设计与本地 Excel 导出）、C++ 数据预处理脚本",
        "difficulties": "仓库系统中 Excel 单元格查空与写入格式保留转换、Tkinter 跨平台控件相对位置适配、小程序云数据库高并发请求状态监视与网络断线容错",
        "innovations": "利用前缀和预处理货物多层分类数据架构；将小程序页面采用“功能+编号”工程化规范命名；编写详尽的学生端与社长端图文操作手册；深度扎根通中校园实际场景，交付即用型数字化服务",
        "fullReportHtml": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n  <!-- 申报正本概述卡片 -->\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800\">全场最高分 · 凌绝望岳</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-950/40 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300 border border-sky-200 dark:border-sky-800\">云极科联（云平台 &amp; 极客社）副社长</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800\">微信小程序 + 云开发 CloudBase</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/40 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800\">Python Tkinter 仓储数字化</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2 font-serif\">项目背景：根植通中校园生活的数字化全栈工程</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-stone-300 mb-3 leading-relaxed font-serif\">\n      朱振鹏同学在担任南通中学“云极科联”（云平台 &amp; 极客社）副社长期间，敏锐洞察校园与企业中的真实数字化痛点，一人独立完成了两大重量级软件工程：<br/>\n      1. <strong>仓储物资数字化管理平台</strong>：针对传统 Excel 仓库表格操作复杂、易误触致错的痛点，使用 Python <code>xlrd / xlwt / xlutils</code> 搭配 Tkinter 相对位置布局开发多级树状分类库存管理桌面系统，并设计前缀和预处理算法优化货物索引。<br/>\n      2. <strong>“南通中学智慧校园”微信小程序矩阵</strong>：包含<strong>社团招新双向审批系统</strong>与<strong>校运会实时赛程成绩积分系统</strong>。改变了以往招新现场填表拥挤混乱、社长汇总耗时滞后的历史，并亲自编写了完整规范的《学生端操作手册》与《社长端操作手册》。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 社团领导力与招新海报展示 (原件大图展示) -->\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 pb-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 font-serif\">\n        <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-600\"></span>\n        云极科联社团活动、招新海报与荣誉证书原件\n      </h3>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300\">社团风采</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 items-start pt-1\">\n      <!-- 海报大图 -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-2 text-center\">\n        <img\n          src=\"/media/2020/zhu_zhenpeng_club_poster.png\"\n          alt=\"云极科联招新宣传海报原件\"\n          class=\"w-full max-h-80 object-contain rounded-lg shadow-sm bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800 p-1\"\n        />\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图1：云极科联招新宣传海报</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">\n          朱振鹏亲手绘制设计（尺寸 2362 &times; 3544，近 7MB 高清原件）\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 社团合影 -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-2 text-center\">\n        <img\n          src=\"/media/2020/zhu_zhenpeng_club_photo.jpg\"\n          alt=\"南通中学云极科联社团合影\"\n          class=\"w-full max-h-80 object-contain rounded-lg shadow-sm\"\n        />\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图2：云极科联社团活动合影</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">\n          南通中学诚恒楼社员线下研讨与项目答辩备赛实况（2020年10月）\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 积极社员证书 -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-2 text-center\">\n        <img\n          src=\"/media/2020/zhu_zhenpeng_active_member.jpg\"\n          alt=\"共青团南通中学委员会积极社员证书\"\n          class=\"w-full max-h-80 object-contain rounded-lg shadow-sm\"\n        />\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图3：校团委“积极社员”荣誉证书</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">\n          在任内多次组织社员志愿义卖、技术分享与学术答疑\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 智慧校园微信小程序操作界面 (选自两份图文操作手册) -->\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 pb-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 font-serif\">\n        <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-600\"></span>\n        “南通中学智慧校园”微信小程序矩阵与操作手册实机图\n      </h3>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-sky-100 dark:bg-sky-900/50 text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-300\">WeChat Mini</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 font-serif leading-relaxed\">\n      小程序采用“功能+编号”工程规范设计，依托微信云开发（CloudBase）实现无服务器免运维部署。作者分别撰写了长达数十页的《学生端操作手册》与《社长端操作手册》，以下为手册中记录的实际交互流程：\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- 小程序截图矩阵 (6幅精选UI) -->\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-1.5 text-center\">\n        <img src=\"/media/2020/zhu_smartcampus/zhu_app_qr_entry.png\" class=\"w-full h-36 object-contain rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800 p-1\" />\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图4：小程序封面入口</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">智慧校园主界面</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-1.5 text-center\">\n        <img src=\"/media/2020/zhu_smartcampus/zhu_app_society_list.jpeg\" class=\"w-full h-36 object-contain rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800 p-1\" />\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图5：全校社团列表</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">社团分类检索</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-1.5 text-center\">\n        <img src=\"/media/2020/zhu_smartcampus/zhu_app_society_detail.jpeg\" class=\"w-full h-36 object-contain rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800 p-1\" />\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图6：社团风采详情</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">招新说明与寄语</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-1.5 text-center\">\n        <img src=\"/media/2020/zhu_smartcampus/zhu_app_apply_form.jpeg\" class=\"w-full h-36 object-contain rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800 p-1\" />\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图7：职位申报表单</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">9位学号实名认证</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-1.5 text-center\">\n        <img src=\"/media/2020/zhu_smartcampus/zhu_app_status_track.jpeg\" class=\"w-full h-36 object-contain rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800 p-1\" />\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图8：进度实时追踪</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">录取通知直接触达</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 shadow-xs space-y-1.5 text-center\">\n        <img src=\"/media/2020/zhu_smartcampus/zhu_app_president_admin.jpeg\" class=\"w-full h-36 object-contain rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800 p-1\" />\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-bold\">图9：社长专属后台</div>\n        <p class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">批量审批与Excel导出</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
