        "fullReportHtml": "<div class=\"not-prose my-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 shadow-xs overflow-hidden font-sans\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-stone-900 via-slate-800 to-sky-950 text-white px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-800\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-300 flex items-center justify-center font-serif font-bold text-sm border border-amber-400/30\">表</div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h4 class=\"text-sm font-serif font-bold tracking-wide text-white\">南通中学 · 望岳奖学金学生申报表</h4><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-200 border border-amber-400/30\">原件正本录入</span></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-300 font-mono mt-0.5\">第四届 (2019-2020) 档案原件数字化录入</p></div></div><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-stone-300 bg-stone-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-stone-700/80\">📅 2020年 12月 8日</span></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800\"><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">👤 申报人姓名</span><span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm\">童亦洲</span></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">🏫 所在班级</span><span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm\">高二5班</span></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">🏷️ 申报项目名称</span><span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm\">System Rui Project (RUIOS 操作系统微内核)</span></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1.5\">🔗 代码托管与开源地址</span><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"http://github.com/ntzxtyz/RUIOS.git\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-100 border border-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:border-blue-800 transition-colors\"><span>http://github.com/ntzxtyz/RUIOS.git</span><span class=\"text-[10px]\">↗</span></a></div></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-200/60 dark:border-stone-700/60 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-medium block mb-1\">👥 团队协作成员与分工</span><span class=\"text-xs text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-serif leading-relaxed\">个人独立开发 (GitHub: @taishang)</span></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-stone-800/40 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-stone-700/80 space-y-2\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>📝 申报项目简介</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2 font-serif\"><p>System Rui Project 是一个面向现代化微内核架构的轻量级操作系统项目。设计上致力于构建完全对用户开放的底层系统——用户可在运行时动态加载甚至更换文件系统、驱动管理器与用户态运行时；而将内存管理、进程调度与内核关键任务保留在内核空间以保障极致性能与安全。截至申报时已完成裸机引导与底层内存管理系统。</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 pt-1\"><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 border border-blue-200/70 dark:border-blue-900/40 space-y-1.5\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>💡 掌握与习得技能</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">Intel x86 处理器技术细节、GCC 内联汇编与 C/C++ 混合编程、操作系统微内核原理、Multiboot2 引导协议、段页式虚拟内存分页与链接脚本编写</div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-200/70 dark:border-amber-900/40 space-y-1.5\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>🛠️ 克服的技术难点</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">裸机环境下缺乏标准运行时库支持，交叉编译、静态链接定位与 QEMU 虚拟机底层寄存器单步调试</div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-200/70 dark:border-emerald-900/40 space-y-1.5\"><h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>✨ 核心创新点</span></h5><div class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">采用高度自定义的用户态执行环境；微内核极简化设计，将驱动、文件系统与 Shell 剥离至用户空间；开机终端定制专属“天依蓝 (#66ccff)”界面</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-6 mt-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-6 mt-6 space-y-6\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-stone-800\">\n    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></span>\n    <h4 class=\"font-serif font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\">📑 System Rui Project 技术报告与微内核设计说明 (Kernel Architecture)</h4>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Hero Header -->\n  <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-sky-200/80 dark:border-sky-900/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50/50 via-white to-blue-50/30 dark:from-stone-900 dark:via-stone-900 dark:to-sky-950/20 p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-sky-100 dark:border-sky-900/40 pb-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#66ccff]/20 text-[#0088cc] dark:text-[#66ccff] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg border border-[#66ccff]/40\">\n          ⚙️\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"font-serif font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">System Rui (RUIOS) 现代操作系统微内核</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-mono mt-0.5\">面向极致模块化与高可靠性的微内核架构操作系统 · C &amp; Assembly</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-sky-100 dark:bg-sky-900/50 text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-300\">Microkernel Ring 0/3</span>\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/50 text-indigo-800 dark:text-indigo-300\">Multiboot2</span>\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-900/50 text-cyan-800 dark:text-cyan-300\">两级分页 MMU</span>\n        <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-[#66ccff]/20 text-[#0077b6] dark:text-[#66ccff] border border-[#66ccff]/30\">天依蓝 #66ccff</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Microkernel Philosophy Card -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-stone-800/60 border border-sky-100/80 dark:border-stone-700/60 space-y-2\">\n      <h5 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <span>🛡️ 项目愿景与微内核设计哲学 (Microkernel Philosophy)</span>\n      </h5>\n      <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">\n        在传统宏内核（Monolithic Kernel）中，文件系统、网络协议栈与设备驱动均运行在最高特权级（Ring 0），单一第三方驱动缺陷便可导致整机蓝屏宕机。<strong>System Rui 秉持微内核设计哲学</strong>：内核态仅保留物理/虚拟内存管理、进程调度与核心 IPC 通信，驱动程序、文件系统与图形渲染均移入用户态（Ring 3），支持运行时动态热插拔与崩溃无缝重启，兼具极致弹性与安全壁垒。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Implementation Highlights Grid -->\n  <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n    <h5 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></span>\n      <span>🔧 底层技术实现与工程架构 (Implementation Details)</span>\n    </h5>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5\">\n      <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 space-y-2\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-lg\">🚀</span>\n          <h6 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 text-xs\">引导扇区与规范兼容</h6>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">\n          编写 <code class=\"font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-stone-900 px-1 py-0.5 rounded\">boot/boot.S</code> 汇编，严格符合 <strong>Multiboot2 规范</strong>，平滑引导至 32/64 位保护模式，初始化全局段描述符（GDT）与中断描述符表（IDT）。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 space-y-2\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-lg\">🧠</span>\n          <h6 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 text-xs\">两级分页与虚拟内存</h6>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">\n          在 <code class=\"font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-stone-900 px-1 py-0.5 rounded\">boot/init.c</code> 与 <code class=\"font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-stone-900 px-1 py-0.5 rounded\">mm/</code> 实现了两级分页机制，精确映射内核保留区域并隔离用户地址空间，杜绝越界覆写。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-stone-700 space-y-2\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-lg\">📐</span>\n          <h6 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 text-xs\">自定义内核链接脚本</h6>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-serif\">\n          自主设计 <code class=\"font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-stone-900 px-1 py-0.5 rounded\">kernel.lds</code> 链接脚本，精确规划 <code class=\"font-mono text-[10px]\">.text</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-[10px]\">.rodata</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-[10px]\">.data</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-[10px]\">.bss</code> 的物理内存对齐边界。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Multiboot & Roadmap -->\n  <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-900/60 p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-mono\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n      <span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-sans\">🌐 开源仓库与多架构蓝图 (Roadmap)</span>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-500 dark:text-stone-400 font-serif\">远景架构规划支持：x86-PC、ARM/MIPS 嵌入式以及 PowerPC 节点</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <a href=\"http://github.com/ntzxtyz/RUIOS.git\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-stone-700 hover:border-sky-500 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 transition-colors\">\n        <span>github.com/ntzxtyz/RUIOS.git</span>\n        <span class=\"text-[10px]\">↗</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
