        "difficulties": "高三学业压力下极其有限的电脑上机时间（在家严格受限）、从零自学 Web 前端与小程序框架、初次执掌大型技术社团化解团队协调危机",
        "innovations": "首创校运会全流程微信小程序生态；搭建“一个联盟+双社长+技术/普及双轨”的全新社团组织机制；自主研发双人同屏弹性物理博弈游戏",
        "fullReportHtml": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200\">2D 物理刚体引擎</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-200\">微信小程序全栈</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200\">极客社校园数字化</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">双模块工程概览</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mb-4\">王喆同学在本届申报中提交了两项扎实的软硬件实践：一是基于刚体碰撞与动量守恒物理机制的竞技对战微游戏<strong>《Fattingball（胖球对决）》</strong>；二是为全校数千名师生打造的<strong>2019南通中学校运会赛事编排与实时成绩流转小程序</strong>。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm flex flex-col justify-between\">\n      <div>\n        <h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-600\"></span>\n          模块一：《胖球对决 Fattingball》\n        </h4>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 mb-3\">利用矢量速度分解与动量定理模拟小球在圆环擂台内的弹性对撞，具备完整的角动量衰减、力矩反馈及阻尼物理引擎：</p>\n        <ul class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4 mb-3\">\n          <li><strong>碰撞检测</strong>：圆-圆连心线投影判别与连续碰撞避免穿透穿模。</li>\n          <li><strong>动态蓄力机制</strong>：触控摇杆角度与拉伸量转换为初速度矢量。</li>\n          <li><strong>胜负裁决算法</strong>：基于同心圆安全区边缘出界判据。</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-700\">\n        Demo 视频已随申请归档，完整展示了高帧率平滑物理运动与音效同步反馈。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm flex flex-col justify-between\">\n      <div>\n        <h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-600\"></span>\n          模块二：校运会极客微信小程序系统\n        </h4>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 mb-3\">重构传统纸质运动会手工登分、广播滞后的低效流程，建立多终端闭环体系：</p>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n            <div class=\"text-sky-700 font-bold mb-1\">体育教研组 / 裁判</div>\n            <div class=\"text-slate-600 text-[11px]\">一键发布日程、限时开启报名、检录状态录入与秒级成绩上传。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n            <div class=\"text-emerald-700 font-bold mb-1\">班主任 / 体委 / 广播台</div>\n            <div class=\"text-slate-600 text-[11px]\">实时查阅本班积分榜、个人前三名直通校广播站播报流水线。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs text-[11px] font-mono text-sky-700\">\n        全校3个年级60余个班级全程平稳运转，彻底解决校运会历史性信息孤岛。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
